    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Describes a single operator attribute as exposed by <ref refid="classONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1_1onnx__op_1_1LightOpSchema" kindref="compound">LightOpSchema</ref>.</para>
<para>Attribute metadata is intentionally lightweight to keep <computeroutput><ref refid="namespaceONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1_1onnx__op" kindref="compound">onnx_op</ref></computeroutput> free of any dependency on the full ONNX schema registry. The <computeroutput>type</computeroutput> field uses the <computeroutput>AttributeType</computeroutput> enumeration above; <computeroutput>default_value</computeroutput> is a typed variant (see :type:<computeroutput>AttributeDefault</computeroutput>) and is <computeroutput>std::monostate</computeroutput> when the attribute is required or has no documented default. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
